    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BEAT THEM ALL AND BECOME THE BEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been chosen to take part in a great magician's tournament. You'll have to face one formidable opponent after another. Fight, prove your place and become the best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902220/extras/fa203f0ac68b2efc89d11229b60a5937.poster.avif?t=1733221721\" width=728 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902220/extras/fa203f0ac68b2efc89d11229b60a5937.webm?t=1733221721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902220/extras/fa203f0ac68b2efc89d11229b60a5937.mp4?t=1733221721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IN THE SCHOOL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between each fight, you'll have the chance to improve your skills, as well as exchanging ideas and forging ties with your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 5 unique boss fight with different mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Create your own custom spell panel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skill tree that enhances your abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A story full of twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cute world </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 2-3 hours of intense combat !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902220/extras/b5cdac39c5cb5a8f65da01971394c61e.poster.avif?t=1733221721\" width=564 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902220/extras/b5cdac39c5cb5a8f65da01971394c61e.webm?t=1733221721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902220/extras/b5cdac39c5cb5a8f65da01971394c61e.mp4?t=1733221721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul>",
